    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait i think i might have that wrong for APA. i thought APA 7th was different from the 6th edition? i pretty sure you use et al. even for the first citation if there are 3 or more authors now. can you double check that for me? also how does chicago handle it if i'm using the author-date system specifically?",
